Taxonomy: US GAAP 2026
**/


rule-name-prefix DQC

/** V32 Release **/
/**

Overview: The US GAAP taxonomy includes elements for each of the columns required in Schedule III Real Estate and Accumulated Depreciation (SEC Regulation S-X 12-28) including encumbrances, initial cost of land, initial cost of buildings and improvements, costs capitalized subsequent to acquisition, gross amount carried of land, buildings and improvements and total, accumulated depreciation, date of construction, date acquired and depreciable life. The taxonomy also includes the elements used to reconcile the real estate and accumulated depreciation balances.  In addition the taxonomy includes the axes required to identify the property, the type of property and the location of the property.  As a result, custom elements should not be needed to tag Schedule III.

Rule US.0254.10974 identifies extension line item elements used in the Schedule III table (srt:RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationByPropertyTable) or in a section whose title identifies it as Schedule III.

Rule US.0254.10975 identifies extension axes used in the Schedule III table (srt:RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationByPropertyTable).

Extension members on the axes are expected, as each property will be represented by a filer defined member, and are not identified by this rule.

**/

/** Identify Schedule III cubes and the presentation networks used for Schedule III **/
constant $SCHEDULE_III_CUBES = filter taxonomy().cubes where $item.cube-concept.name == srt:RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationByPropertyTable

constant $SCHEDULE_III_ROLES = (filter $SCHEDULE_III_CUBES returns $item.drs-role.uri).to-set

constant $SCHEDULE_III_NETWORKS = filter $PRES_NETWORKS where $item.role.uri in $SCHEDULE_III_ROLES
									or $item.role.description.lower-case.contains('schedule iii')
									or ($item.role.description.lower-case.contains('real estate and accumulated depreciation') and $item.role.description.contains('- Schedule -'))

ASSERT US.0254.10974 SATISFIED

$rule_id = (rule-name().split('.'))[rule-name().split('.').length];

/** DQCRT RULE **/
if not applicable_form(rule-name())
	skip
else

for $network in $SCHEDULE_III_NETWORKS.sort
	/** Only the reportable line items are evaluated.  Abstracts, tables, axes and members are excluded. **/
	$extensionLineItems = filter $network.concepts
							where not $item.is-abstract
							and $item.substitution == xbrli:item
							and is_extension($item, $ALL_BASE_TAXONOMIES_ELTS)
							returns $item.name

	/** Only report the extension elements that have facts in the filing **/
	$usedExtensionLineItems = filter $extensionLineItems where list({covered @concept = $item}).length > 0

	$usedExtensionLineItems.length > 0

message
"The Schedule III Real Estate and Accumulated Depreciation section \"{$network.role.description}\" uses the following extension element(s):

{$usedExtensionLineItems.sort.join('\n')}

The US GAAP taxonomy includes elements for each of the columns required in Schedule III such as encumbrances (srt:RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationAmountOfEncumbrances), the initial cost of land and buildings, costs capitalized subsequent to acquisition, the gross amount at which land, buildings and improvements are carried, accumulated depreciation, date of construction, date acquired and depreciable life, as well as the elements used to reconcile the real estate and accumulated depreciation balances. Custom elements should not be needed to tag Schedule III. Please replace the extension element(s) with the appropriate US GAAP or SRT taxonomy element.

Rule Element Id:{$rule_id}
Rule version: {$ruleVersion}"

severity error

effectiveDate $effective_dates[$rule_id]


ASSERT US.0254.10975 SATISFIED

$rule_id = (rule-name().split('.'))[rule-name().split('.').length];

/** DQCRT RULE **/
if not applicable_form(rule-name())
	skip
else

for $cube in $SCHEDULE_III_CUBES
	$extensionAxes = filter $cube.dimensions
						where is_extension($item.concept, $ALL_BASE_TAXONOMIES_ELTS)
						returns $item.concept.name

	$extensionAxes.length > 0

message
"The Schedule III table srt:RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationByPropertyTable in the section \"{$cube.drs-role.description}\" uses the following extension axis: {$extensionAxes.sort.join(', ')}.  The US GAAP taxonomy includes the axes needed to tag Schedule III Real Estate and Accumulated Depreciation. Each property should be identified using srt:RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis.  When needed, the type of property can be identified using srt:MortgageLoansOnRealEstateDescriptionTypeOfPropertyAxis and the location of the property can be identified using srt:StatementGeographicalAxis.  Please replace the extension axis with the appropriate taxonomy axis.

Rule Element Id:{$rule_id}
Rule version: {$ruleVersion}"

severity error

effectiveDate $effective_dates[$rule_id]
